{"seq":28,"trial_id":"anatomy-instruction-route-2026-11/hermes-haiku-gbrain-route-startup-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-30T18:45:23.198Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"4d2d1ceaa67a9a651e28c18853ce28248443b47e0abbbb59cd5813291f171fcf","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","text":"Pree, here's what I found for Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers, from what you can see:\n\n1. #4409 - Moss's Central handoffs digest (teams/team-central/digests/2026-01-02-central-handoffs.md). Gatehouse Check-In report timeout at Salina North. The digest lists it under the Marrow Fieldworks handoff, but it calls it \"Pree's dealer account\", so please confirm it's Fieldworks.\n2. #4412 - same digest, same caveat. Driver SMS prompt glitch on unpaved overflow lots.\n3. PD-5302 - #central-random, Hollis, 14 Oct 2026. Follow-up from this week, no action needed.\n\nNot included: Moss's cheat sheet and North notes name no Fieldworks tickets. #8841 (13 Oct, #central-random) is on Tobias's Plains depots, not Fieldworks. Marrow Agrisupply tickets (PD-4821, FR-882) are a different account. #central-team and #help-it-ops have no Fieldworks ticket numbers that I can see."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
