{"seq":30,"trial_id":"anatomy-instruction-route-2026-11/hermes-haiku-gbrain-route-startup-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-30T18:45:35.444Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e441255f339157e529d22f4b0aa13a195dd2e8389fe1fb9ec927ab11f989a26f","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","text":"I posted the list in our DM. Summary:\n\n1. #4409 and #4412 come from Moss's Central handoffs digest (2 Jan 2026). The digest puts them under \"Pre-handoff items\" and calls the account \"Pree's dealer account\" without naming Fieldworks, so they are unconfirmed as Fieldworks tickets.\n2. PD-5302 comes from #central-random (Hollis, 14 Oct 2026). Hollis says it is a Marrow Fieldworks follow-up from this week, with no action needed.\n\nI checked Moss's other notes, #central-team, #help-it-ops, and the North digests, and found no other Fieldworks ticket numbers. #8841 is on Plains depots and PD-4821 and FR-882 are Marrow Agrisupply, so I left them out.\n\nI posted a correction in the DM because my first message said the digest lists #4409 and #4412 under the Fieldworks handoff, which it doesn't."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","ts":"1792159200.000129"}}
